graph TB
    User["Data Scientist"] -->|"creates (modelFormat: autogluon)"| ISVC["InferenceService CR<br/>serving.kserve.io"]
    ISVC -->|watched by| KServeCtrl["KServe Controller<br/>(separate RHOAI kserve component)"]
    CSR["ClusterServingRuntime<br/>kserve-autogluonserver<br/>autogluon v1, autoSelect<br/>protocols v1/v2"] -->|selected by| KServeCtrl
    KServeCtrl -->|creates| PredictorPod

    subgraph PredictorPod["Predictor Pod (user namespace)"]
        direction TB
        StorageInit["storage-initializer<br/>(init container)"]
        Vol[("/mnt/models<br/>shared volume")]
        StorageInit -->|writes model| Vol

        subgraph Server["kserve-container: autogluonserver (UID 1001)"]
            direction TB
            Main["__main__<br/>python -m autogluonserver<br/>--model_dir, --http_port 8080"]
            RuntimePaths["runtime_paths<br/>MPLCONFIGDIR, writable cwd"]
            Factory["AutoGluonDetectedModel<br/>create_autogluon_model"]
            VersionCompat["version_compat<br/>reject major/minor mismatch"]
            TS["AutoGluonTimeSeriesModel<br/>REST v1 only"]
            Tab["AutoGluonTabularModel<br/>REST v1/v2, gRPC v2<br/>PREDICT_PROBA"]
            Repo["AutoGluonModelRepository<br/>(fallback on ModelMissingError)"]
            SDK["KServe Python SDK<br/>FastAPI/uvicorn :8080<br/>gRPC v2 :8081, /metrics"]
            StorageLib["kserve-storage<br/>S3/GCS/Azure/HDFS/HTTP/Git"]

            Main --> RuntimePaths
            Main --> Factory
            Main -.->|fallback| Repo
            Factory -->|"1. try TimeSeriesPredictor.load"| TS
            Factory -->|"2. fallback TabularPredictor.load"| Tab
            Factory --> VersionCompat
            Factory -->|Storage.download| StorageLib
            Main -->|starts| SDK
        end
        Vol -->|read / unpickle| Factory
    end

    StorageInit -->|HTTPS/443| ObjStore["Object Storage<br/>S3 / GCS / Azure"]
    StorageLib -.->|"HTTPS/443 (remote URI only)"| ObjStore
    Client["Inference Client"] -->|"HTTP/8080 via predictor Service"| SDK
    Prom["Prometheus"] -->|scrape /metrics| SDK

    AutoGluon["AutoGluon 1.5.0+rhaiv.3<br/>torch 2.11.0, LightGBM, XGBoost, fastai<br/>(no CatBoost)"]
    TS --> AutoGluon
    Tab --> AutoGluon

    style Main fill:#4a90e2
    style Factory fill:#4a90e2
    style TS fill:#4a90e2
    style Tab fill:#4a90e2
    style Repo fill:#4a90e2
    style VersionCompat fill:#4a90e2
    style RuntimePaths fill:#4a90e2
    style SDK fill:#7fb3e8
    style StorageLib fill:#7fb3e8
    style ISVC fill:#f5a623
    style CSR fill:#f5a623
    style KServeCtrl fill:#7ed321
    style StorageInit fill:#7ed321
    style ObjStore fill:#e8e8e8
    style AutoGluon fill:#e8e8e8
    style Prom fill:#e8e8e8
